# Test 2: Comparisons and if/else
let x = 10
print(x == 10)
print(x != 10)
print(x < 5)
print(x > 5)
print(x <= 10)
print(x >= 11)

if (x >= 10) {
    print(x)
}
else {
    print(0)
}

if (x < 10) {
    print("small")
} else {
    if (x == 10) {
        print("exactly ten")
    } else {
        print("big")
    }
}
